1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:01,388
(sighs)

2
00:00:01,389 --> 00:00:02,789
(stammers)

3
00:00:02,791 --> 00:00:06,331
(Sheldon:)You could have set Newton's
gravitational constant to one.

4
00:00:06,328 --> 00:00:08,758
(Sheldon:)And, ugh, the whole thing reeks
of blueberry.

5
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:11,463
(Sheldon:)You know I can't stand
these scented markers.

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,830
(Leonard:)No one told you to taste them.

7
00:00:15,937 --> 00:00:17,967
Come on, is-is this
good or not?

8
00:00:17,973 --> 00:00:19,503
(sighs deeply)

9
00:00:19,508 --> 00:00:20,908
(Sheldon:)It's good.

10
00:00:20,909 --> 00:00:22,779
(Leonard:)Really?
I like it.

11
00:00:22,777 --> 00:00:24,107
(Sheldon:)I think you're on to something.

12
00:00:24,112 --> 00:00:25,442
(Leonard:)You do? You're not
messing with me?

13
00:00:25,447 --> 00:00:26,577
(Sheldon:)Not at all.

14
00:00:26,581 --> 00:00:28,811
(Sheldon:)In fact,
I have got something

15
00:00:28,817 --> 00:00:30,247
(Sheldon:)for just such
an occasion.

16
00:00:30,252 --> 00:00:31,422
(Sheldon:)I was starting to think

17
00:00:31,419 --> 00:00:33,519
(Sheldon:)I might never get a chance
to give it to you.

18
00:00:33,522 --> 00:00:34,992
(Sheldon:)Good job.

19
00:00:39,961 --> 00:00:42,431
(Leonard:)You're giving me a sticker?

20
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:44,430
(Sheldon:)Not just a sticker.

21
00:00:44,432 --> 00:00:47,902
(Sheldon:)That is a sticker of a kitty
saying, "Me-wow!"

22
00:00:49,971 --> 00:00:52,041
(Leonard:)I'm not a preschooler.

23
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,040
(stammers)
Fine, I'll take it back.

24
00:00:54,042 --> 00:00:56,272
I earned this!
Back off!

25
00:00:56,278 --> 00:01:00,018
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

